        {
          "id": 66,
          "title": "<h3 class=\"text-[26px] leading-[1.125] font-bold md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px]\">Master Your PDFs in Seconds</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-[1.286] dark:text-gray-400 text-variant\"><p>Get more from your PDF in seconds. Summarize, translate, and analyze documents instantly. Have questions? AI Chat gives quick, accurate answers—saving you time and helping you focus on what matters most. It’s smart, fast, and built for productivity.</p></div>",
